  "details": "Hello there. I have a weird idea. Last time i found my joystick which will be confortable for me to play some games, but then there was an idea if i can use joystick (Logitech Force 3dPro) as a controller. It can turn in different directions, it `could` rotate the camera diagonaly, and i thought that it will work with VRChat so i tried to do this but it did not turn in all directions and in the wrong way(binds). next time before starting the game i checked the binds for joystick and tried to change it, but i realized that i don;t know how and there is unknown values for me xd. i know i can use gamepad for this but it can't turn camera in additional way. so it became a little interesting for me(very). but if VRChat can't support it and there is absolutely No way to do that, then ok. anyway Thanks a lot for reading my bad english",
